YBHa34Dd8Q3IcHCD8oCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"這裡的停車情況如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_PLENTY_OF_PARKING"],"很多停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYgKqh89SWAxXwh1YBHa34Dd8Q3YcHCEIoAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwjYgKqh89SWAxXwh1YBHa34Dd8Q3IcHCEEoCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_GARAGE"],"付費室內停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYgKqh89SWAxXwh1YBHa34Dd8Q3YcHCEQoAA"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwjYgKqh89SWAxXwh1YBHa34Dd8Q3IcHCEMoCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYgKqh89SWAxXwh1YBHa34Dd8Q3YcHCEYoAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYgKqh89SWAxXwh1YBHa34Dd8Q3IcHCEUoDA",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["想分享一件最近覺得很有趣的小事\n\n那天跟女朋友做完汗蒸幕回家，腦袋只有一個念頭：\n好想吃鬼匠拉麵\n\n雖然是連鎖店，但不知道為什麼，我一直覺得新莊這家最好吃，尤其是紅湯雪花牛，吃了五年還是我的第一名\n\n即使搬到土城，我偶爾還是會特地叫新莊店的外送\n\n偏偏那天雨下得很大，整個新莊都沒有外送員\n我第一次發現，原來一個人為了吃，真的可以想盡辦法\n\nUber eat不行，就換 Lalamove；Lalamove 也一直沒人接，我就一路把小費往上加，從一百多一路加到 266 元\n\n最後，終於有人願意接單\n\n那碗拉麵送到的時候，我是真的覺得很值得\n\n不是因為它有多便宜，而是因為有些店，真的值得你花一點力氣去支持\n\n一路吃了五年，味道始終沒變\n\n我想，真正讓人願意一直回訪的，從來不是運氣，而是老闆一直把品質做好\n\n所以這篇不是業配，只是想認真跟老闆說一句：\n謝謝你們一直維持著我心中最好吃的那碗拉麵\n我會繼續支持",null,[0,40]]]],[null,1785688483000000,1785688483000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfYU1zSHFDT2JHNW90ajdmeTBESnR4QQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfYU1zSHFDT2JHNW90ajdmeTBESnR4QRoTQ2d3SW8tTzkwd1lRbnZuejJnRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjYgKqh89SWAxXwh1YBHa34Dd8Q_2MIRygN"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4UWxGVVVrbFNWa0l4V1ZWb1psbHRiRlZVTTA1MlVUQldRbGx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4UWxGVVVrbFNWa0l4V1ZWb1psbHRiRlZVTTA1MlVUQldRbGx0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4UWxGVVVrbFNWa0l4V1ZWb1psbHRiRlZVTTA1MlVUQldRbGx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4UWxGVVVrbFNWa0l4V1ZWb1psbHRiRlZVTTA1MlVUQldRbGx0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4UWxGVVVrbFNWa0l4V1ZWb1psbHRiRlZVTTA1MlVUQldRbGx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4UWxGVVVrbFNWa0l4V1ZWb1psbHRiRlZVTTA1MlVUQldRbGx0WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["首先~很感謝您的訂購\n小店的每位工作人員都能感受您真心支持愛護~\n也為我們帶來動力~\n評論我很早就看到了~\n只是一直在想要如何回覆~\n其實一路走來也很多年頭了~\n心中想法也會有所變動~\n早期剛作~說真的吃的人不多~心中也一直告訴自已不管人多人少也要用心煮出一碗有溫度的麵~讓來的客人能感受到好的用餐體驗~\n等到作久了～也積累了一定客源～有時候也會忙到懷疑品質有無顧好～\n我想一定是有疏忽沒作好的時候～\n所以也很感謝在過程中客人對小店提出那裡有問題跟可改進的地方～\n讓小店能注意～\n但說句真的作久熱誠難免慢慢消減～也會懷疑自已真的有作好嗎～\n所以一直在提醒自已要保持自已的熱誠～\n但我一直提醒自已，也沒您這評價來的有用～\n所以真的很感謝您，您的評論真的給小弟很大的動力跟信心～\n小店也會保持熱誠跟用心在餐點上～\n感恩～\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",null,[0,42]]]],[null,null,600,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxQlFUUklSVkIxWVVoZlltbFVUM052UTBWQlltYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xaec64ccb1bdbff4e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk1BQTRIRVB1YUhfYmlUT3NvQ0VBYmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxQlFUUklSVkIxWVVoZlltbFVUM052UTBWQlltYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxQlFUUklSVkIxWVVoZlltbFVUM052UTBWQlltYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxQlFUUklSVkIxWVVoZlltbFVUM052UTBWQlltYxILMGVOZ1NTZ1hFNl8aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rMUJRVFJJUlZCMVlVaGZZbWxVVDNOdlEwVkJZbWMSCzBlTmdTU2dYRTZfIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARTv_bG8tMxq4qCzBlTmdTU2dYRTZf\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d28673232